<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>HK WorldBank - 인류와 기술이 공존하는 차세대 디지털 금융 혁신</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-main: #060212;
            --bg-card: #0f0728;
            --bg-card-inner: #150a36;
            --accent-cyan: #00f0ff;
            --accent-purple: #9d00ff;
            --accent-pink: #ff007f;
            --accent-gold: #ffd700;
            --accent-emerald: #00ff88;
            --accent-blue: #2979ff;
            --text-main: #ffffff;
            --text-muted: #9aa0c0;
            --border-glow: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.35);
            --shadow-neon-cyan: 0 0 15px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.4);
            --shadow-neon-purple: 0 0 15px rgba(157, 0, 255, 0.4);
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Pretendard', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
            -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-main);
            color: var(--text-main);
            line-height: 1.6;
            padding-bottom: 60px;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1240px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 14px;
        }

        /* ----------------------------------
           상단 헤더 & 네비게이션
        ---------------------------------- */
        header {
            background: rgba(15, 7, 40, 0.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-glow);
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 1000;
            padding: 10px 0;
        }

        .header-content {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .header-brand {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .brand-logo {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-cyan), var(--accent-pink));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .referrer-tag {
            background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid var(--accent-cyan);
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            padding: 4px 10px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-neon-cyan);
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 12px;
            overflow-x: auto;
            padding-bottom: 2px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
        }

        .nav-links a {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-decoration: none;
            white-space: nowrap;
            transition: color 0.2s;
        }

        .nav-links a:hover {
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
        }

        .header-right {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .lang-select {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            border: 1px solid var(--accent-cyan);
            padding: 5px 10px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            outline: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.2);
        }

        /* ----------------------------------
           히어로 메인 섹션
        ---------------------------------- */
        .hero-section {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px 10px 30px;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(157, 0, 255, 0.15) 0%, transparent 70%);
        }

        .hero-subtitle-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid var(--accent-cyan);
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .hero-title {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            line-height: 1.3;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 30%, #a5c0ff 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        .hero-desc {
            font-size: 0.88rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto 20px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .hero-btns {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 10px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        /* ----------------------------------
           공통 섹션 카드 (고대비 발광)
        ---------------------------------- */
        .section-card {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-glow);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 22px;
            margin-top: 24px;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-neon-purple);
            position: relative;
        }

        .section-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.15);
            padding-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.6);
        }

        .badge-glow {
            background: var(--accent-purple);
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            padding: 2px 8px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--accent-purple);
        }

        /* ----------------------------------
           1. 고객센터 AGI '삐니'
        ---------------------------------- */
        .agi-container {
            background: rgba(6, 2, 18, 0.7);
            border: 1px solid rgba(157, 0, 255, 0.4);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 14px;
        }

        .chat-window {
            height: 150px;
            overflow-y: auto;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            padding-right: 6px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 10px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }

        .chat-msg {
            padding: 10px 14px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            max-width: 90%;
            word-break: break-all;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }

        .chat-msg.bot {
            background: rgba(157, 0, 255, 0.15);
            border: 1px solid rgba(157, 0, 255, 0.5);
            color: #e2d5ff;
            align-self: flex-start;
        }

        .chat-msg.user {
            background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.15);
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.5);
            color: #d5f8ff;
            align-self: flex-end;
        }

        .chat-controls {
            display: flex;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .chat-input {
            flex: 1;
            background: var(--bg-main);
            border: 1px solid var(--accent-cyan);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 10px 12px;
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            outline: none;
        }

        .btn-neon {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-cyan), var(--accent-purple));
            color: #fff;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 0 16px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-neon-cyan);
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        /* ----------------------------------
           2. 10대 핵심 모듈 (2열 5행 2x5 그리드)
        ---------------------------------- */
        .grid-2x5 {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 10px;
        }

        @media (min-width: 768px) {
            .grid-2x5 {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
            }
        }

        .module-card {
            background: rgba(6, 2, 18, 0.85);
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.25);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 12px 10px;
            text-align: center;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.25s ease;
        }

        .module-card:hover {
            border-color: var(--accent-cyan);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-neon-cyan);
            background: var(--bg-card-hover);
        }

        .module-icon {
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
            display: block;
        }

        .module-title {
            font-size: 0.88rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            margin-bottom: 3px;
        }

        .module-sub {
            font-size: 0.72rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            word-break: keep-all;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }

        /* ----------------------------------
           3. 백서 100선 카테고리 & 전 항목 (이미지 3,4 기반)
        ---------------------------------- */
        .wp-category-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        @media (min-width: 768px) {
            .wp-category-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
            }
        }

        .wp-cat-box {
            background: rgba(157, 0, 255, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(157, 0, 255, 0.3);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 10px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .wp-cat-num {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
        }

        .wp-cat-lbl {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        .wp-block-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 14px;
        }

        @media (min-width: 768px) {
            .wp-block-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }
        }

        .wp-block {
            background: var(--bg-card-inner);
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.2);
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 14px;
        }

        .wp-block-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            padding-bottom: 6px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }

        .wp-block-title {
            font-size: 0.88rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .wp-range-badge {
            background: var(--accent-blue);
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 0.68rem;
            padding: 2px 6px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .wp-list {
            list-style: none;
            font-size: 0.74rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 4px;
        }

        .wp-list li {
            line-height: 1.35;
        }

        .wp-list li strong {
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
        }

        /* ----------------------------------
           4. FAQ 20선 전문 (이미지 5,6 기반)
        ---------------------------------- */
        .faq-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        @media (min-width: 768px) {
            .faq-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }
        }

        .faq-item {
            background: var(--bg-card-inner);
            border: 1px solid rgba(157, 0, 255, 0.25);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 12px;
        }

        .faq-q {
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .faq-a {
            font-size: 0.76rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            line-height: 1.35;
        }

        /* ----------------------------------
           5. 순수익 30%~60% 사회환원 (UBI) 시뮬레이터 (이미지 7 기반)
        ---------------------------------- */
        .ubi-stats-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
        }

        @media (min-width: 600px) {
            .ubi-stats-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            }
        }

        .ubi-box {
            background: rgba(0, 255, 136, 0.04);
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 136, 0.4);
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 14px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .ubi-val {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: var(--accent-emerald);
            text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0, 255, 136, 0.6);
        }

        .ubi-lbl {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-top: 2px;
        }

        .sim-widget {
            background: rgba(6, 2, 18, 0.8);
            border: 1px solid var(--accent-cyan);
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 16px;
            margin-top: 12px;
        }

        .sim-input-group {
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .sim-label {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            margin-bottom: 4px;
            display: block;
        }

        .sim-input {
            width: 100%;
            background: var(--bg-main);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-glow);
            padding: 8px;
            color: #fff;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }

        .sim-range {
            width: 100%;
            margin-top: 6px;
        }

        .sim-results {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 8px;
            margin-top: 10px;
            background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.05);
            padding: 10px;
            border-radius: 6px;
        }

        .sim-res-item {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .sim-res-val {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: var(--accent-gold);
        }

        .sim-res-lbl {
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        /* ----------------------------------
           6 & 7. 정책 및 법안 통과 (이미지 8,9 기반)
        ---------------------------------- */
        .policy-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        @media (min-width: 768px) {
            .policy-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }
        }

        .policy-box {
            background: var(--bg-card-inner);
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.25);
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 14px;
        }

        .policy-title {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .policy-item {
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .policy-item-title {
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: var(--accent-emerald);
        }

        .policy-item-desc {
            font-size: 0.73rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        .law-tags {
            display: flex;
            gap: 6px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        .law-tag {
            background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid var(--accent-cyan);
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            padding: 3px 8px;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        /* ----------------------------------
           8. 10대 분산 연동망 프로세스 상세 (이미지 9 기반)
        ---------------------------------- */
        .grid-10-detail {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 8px;
        }

        @media (min-width: 768px) {
            .grid-10-detail {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
            }
        }

        .detail-card {
            background: rgba(6, 2, 18, 0.9);
            border: 1px solid rgba(157, 0, 255, 0.3);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 10px;
        }

        .detail-num {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            margin-bottom: 2px;
        }

        .detail-desc {
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            line-height: 1.25;
        }

        /* ----------------------------------
           4. 미디어 방송 섹션 (유튜브)
        ---------------------------------- */
        .media-frame {
            position: relative;
            padding-bottom: 56.25%;
            height: 0;
            overflow: hidden;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border: 1px solid var(--accent-purple);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-neon-purple);
        }

        .media-frame iframe {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            border: none;
        }

        /* ----------------------------------
           푸터
        ---------------------------------- */
        footer {
            margin-top: 40px;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-glow);
            padding-top: 24px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .support-mail {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .support-mail a {
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .social-row {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .social-btn {
            flex: 1;
            max-width: 160px;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 8px 0;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }

        .btn-yt {
            background: rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.15);
            border: 1px solid #ff0000;
            color: #ff4d4d;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }

        .btn-tt {
            background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.15);
            border: 1px solid var(--accent-cyan);
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-neon-cyan);
        }

        .copyright {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            opacity: 0.6;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- 상단 헤더 -->
    <header>
        <div class="container header-content">
            <div class="header-brand">
                <span class="brand-logo">HK WorldBank</span>
                <span class="referrer-tag">추천인 ID: ljw2358</span>
            </div>
            <div class="nav-links">
                <a href="#agi">AGI 삐니</a>
                <a href="#modules">10대 모듈</a>
                <a href="#wp">백서 100선</a>
                <a href="#faq">FAQ 20선</a>
                <a href="#ubi">사회환원 & UBI</a>
                <a href="#policies">정책 & 법안</a>
                <a href="#decentralized">분산 연동망</a>
            </div>
            <div class="header-right">
                <select class="lang-select" id="globalLangSelect">
                    <option value="ko">한국어 (Korean)</option>
                    <option value="en">English</option>
                    <option value="ja">日本語</option>
                    <option value="zh">中文</option>
                    <option value="es">Español</option>
                    <option value="vi">Tiếng Việt</option>
                </select>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- 히어로 메인 -->
    <section class="hero-section container">
        <span class="hero-subtitle-badge">🌐 글로벌 웹3 디지털 금융 & 사회환원 통합 플랫폼 (hkwb.world)</span>
        <h1 class="hero-title">인류와 기술이 공존하는<br>차세대 디지털 금융 혁신</h1>
        <p class="hero-desc">
            순수익 최대 60% 투명한 사회환원(UBI), 60개국어 실시간 AGI 고객센터 '삐니', 그리고 10대 분산 연동망이 당신의 자산을 안전하고 지혜롭게 관리합니다.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-btns">
            <button class="btn-neon" onclick="location.href='#modules'">⚡ 10대 핵심 모듈 실행</button>
            <button class="btn-neon" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-purple), var(--accent-pink));" onclick="location.href='#agi'">🤖 AGI 삐니와 대화하기</button>
        </div>
    </section>

    <main class="container">
        <!-- 1. 고객센터 AGI '삐니' -->
        <section class="section-card" id="agi">
            <div class="section-header">
                <h2 class="section-title">🤖 1. 고객센터 AGI '삐니'</h2>
                <span class="badge-glow">60개국어 실시간 음성/문자 AGI</span>
            </div>
            <div class="agi-container">
                <div class="chat-window" id="chatWindow">
                    <div class="chat-msg bot">
                        <strong>삐니:</strong> 안녕하십니까! HK WorldBank 공식 고객센터 AGI 삐니입니다. 60개국어 동시 음성 및 문자 상담을 지원하며, 예치 이율, 추천인 혜택, 파이 생태계 연동, UBI 분배 로직 등 모든 문의를 신속히 처리해 드립니다.
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="chat-controls">
                    <input type="text" class="chat-input" id="chatInput" placeholder="삐니에게 질문하기 (예: 예치 이율 확인, 추천인 ID, 사회환원 등)..." onkeypress="handleKeyPress(event)">
                    <button class="btn-neon" onclick="sendChatMessage()">전송</button>
                </div>
            </div>
